WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
MuJoCo kinematic concept. The excavator lowers an illustrative clamp and closes it around a TPMS block.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
The scripted arm lifts the block from the pickup position.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The upper body rotates, transferring the block toward the coastal assembly layout.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The arm lowers the block beside the stationary partner.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The block approaches a nominal adjacent alignment. Contact forces and fit are not validated.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The clamp opens and withdraws. This is scripted CAD motion, not a physical assembly test.
